window.products.push({"id":214087,"name":"Meajore 3D Large Number Cake Mould,Silicone Baking Letter Ectangle Novel Cake Tins Stencil Perfect in Large Numbers for 6/60th Birthday or Anniversary","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wsthmmY3S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS：Extra large size food grade silicone meet FDA standards,Elastic,can be squeezed and takes up a small spacenon-sticky, reusable, durable, temperature range -40°F to +446°F (-40°C to +230°C) APPLICABLE OCCASIONS:The use of 3D digital silicone molds can be used in some special commemorative occasions, such as making DIY cakes for your child’s birthday, wedding, anniversaries and other occasions, or making some numbers that are meaningful to your life, for you Life adds a sense of ritual and fun HYGIENIC DESIGN:The mold is easy to clean. It can be rinsed with water or can be cleaned with a sponge. It can be used in ovens microwaves dishwashers and refrigerators HOW TO USE: When making, first mix the raw materials evenly, pour them into digital molds, put them in the baking pan, bake and cool. When taking out the food, gently press the mold with your hand, and the food will easily fall off. Use the numbers you like to make your own handmade work EXCELLENT SERVICE: If you have any question or you! re not satisfied with our product, please feel free to contact us by email so we are able to provide you with the best solution","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wsthmmY3S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Meajore","source_asin":"B08SQX99XN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-214087","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SQX99XN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SQX99XN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
