window.products.push({"id":214164,"name":"Vic Firth Columbia 6-Inch Pepper Mill, Mahogany","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+LCahsmBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Exacting chefs want and need complete control over the seasoning of their dishes - and Vic Firth Gourmet mills give them precise control through a patented Lock and Grind grinding system. This unique mechanism ensures perfect consistency - whether fine grinds for fish, medium grinds for gravies or coarse grinds for meats. Grinding is performed in a two-step process: first the peppercorns are crushed to release their natural oils and flavors; next, they are ground to the chosen consistency for perfect results every time. This upside down mill eliminates the mess that traditional pepper mills leave behind. With the Vic Firth Columbia mill, you’ll have complete control – to create the perfect grind and have it where you want it – in your food – and not on your table and countertops. All Vic Firth mills feature pop-out mechanisms for easy cleaning. All Vic Firth wood products are handcrafted in Newport, Maine and carry a lifetime guarantee. Outstanding quality, unique design - the last mill that you’ll ever need. 6-inch tall. Mahogany","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+LCahsmBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vic Firth","source_asin":"B001EN7TT2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-214164","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001EN7TT2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001EN7TT2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":214165,"name":"Reusable Silicone Food Bags - 2 Large - 2 Medium - 4 Sizes Collapsible Measuring Silicone Cups - Airtight Seal Food Preservation Bags - Eco Friendly L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81srPCWD3fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Greenli Reusable Silicone Food Bags are designed with our Customers’ needs in mind.① Multifunctional: store, cook, freeze, warm up food. Leakproof silicone bags can be used to not only hold solid food, but also safely store liquids - sauce, soup, smoothies. ② Perfect addition to your healthy lifestyle Reusable Silicone Food Storage Bags set of 4 help you keep your kitchen organized and save space. You can take your favorite food with you to work / picnic. Seal Food Preservation Bags are travel-friendly.③ Save Money & The Environment The airtight seal locks in flavor and freshness, keeps out bacteria and oxidizing particles from the air. You don’t need to spend money on buying plastic bags as the silicone storage food bags are reusable and will serve you for many years. The packaging is completely eco-friendly.④ Specifications:- Versatile Preservation Bags- Material: food grade silicone- Size: 2 Large bags; 2 Medium- Colors: transparent, red, green, blue - Package includes: 4 Reusable Silicon Food Bags (2 silicone food storage bag large, 2 medium), 4 Sizes of Collapsible Silicone Measuring Cups, instructions- Fully recyclable packaging- Silicone Reusable Food Bag Snack StorageTips for Using:1. Open & Close. Match up the arrows on the bags and clip, pull tightly closed to seal the food preservation bag.2. Temperature resistance. Can withstand high temperature heating in microwave oven and storage in freezer. Remove the slider before heating silicone lunch bags.3. Washing & Drying. Dishwasher safe. You can also easily clean our bags by hand. Turn them inside out, wash with soap and warm water. Keep them inside out for drying or put the bags on top of a cup to air dry.4. Airtight Seal Food Preservation Bags can be safely portable while carrying solid or semi-solid food. Please exercise extra caution when using them to transport liquid food. Pull the slider bar to the end to seal the bags.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81srPCWD3fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Greenli","source_asin":"B07WFWK6F6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-214165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WFWK6F6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WFWK6F6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
