window.products.push({"id":214239,"name":"KavRave Satin Pillowcase for Hair and Skin, 2-Pack Pillow Cases - Cooling Satin Pillow Covers with Envelope Closure (Pure White, King 20''×36'')","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ugyzrbUVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KavRave satin pillowcases keep you warm in cold and cool in hot to establish a sound sleep all night. Luxury satin pillowcase with stain resistant feature provides smooth and soft feeling to ensure you tight sleep. Shield a protective layer in order to wash and switch easier than your luxury pillow from season to season to protect your whole family away from allergens. Satin pillowcases are not only more attractive than cotton pillowcases in appearance, but also more obvious than cotton pillowcases in terms of using effect.The smooth and soft surface of the satin pillowcase can reduce the friction between the hair and the pillowcase and help prevent the hair from tangling and knotting while you are sleeping. Every morning is a new beginning after you having a good sleep. Choosing a good satin pillowcase is a commitment to sleep quality. satin pillowcases for hair and skin benefit the condition of your beauty to minimize hair breakage and loss. Non-absorbent satin pillowcases create less friction to maintain hair moisture. Soft Touching The satin pillowcase is elastic, which makes you feel very comfortable and soft when you touch it. Neat Strong Stitches Neat stitches enhance strong connections at seams, which ensures the pillowcase does not crack or fall off the stitch. Envelop closure design Envelope closure end design. Your pillow will be held securely inside the satin pillowcase while you sleep, and there are no zippers to poke at you while you sleep. Care instruction: turn the satin pillow case inside out, place inside a mesh laundry bag, and wash with a mild detergent. Iron on low heat Do not bleach Tumble dry with low heat","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ugyzrbUVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KavRave","source_asin":"B095PG73HW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-214239","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095PG73HW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095PG73HW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
