window.products.push({"id":214333,"name":"Pokytcox Commercial Convection Oven,47 L/50Qt Countertop Commercial Toaster, 1600W Efficiency Heat,120V, Stainless Steel, Silver,4 Racks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51o7D6hlOGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【47 L/50Qt Large Capacity】: The commercial convection oven has a 50qt (47L) internal capacity and space. With a 4-level interior up to 47L, this oven is perfect for cooking lots of delicious food, enough for the whole family. A must-have for parties or commercial use 【Cyclone Hot Air Circulation】: The oven is 1600W high power with 4 heating tubes for super fast preheating in minutes, cooking food efficiently in the healthiest way, 85% less Fat. It feature high-efficiency fans that ensure that heat is evenly distributed throughout the whole body to bake food quickly. Equipped with 2 easy-to-operate knobs for precise control of heating temperature and baking time. Heating temperature range: 150-500°F (65-260°C); Time setting: 0-120 minutes 【Max Continuous Use 6 Hours】The toaster ovens are designed for home and commercial use for defrosting, fermenting, etc. Super durable heating tube, allowing the oven to be used continuously for up to 6 hours, Widely used in snack bars, bread shops, restaurant kitchens, etc. Let you cook food faster, more and more efficiently. Perfect for baking delicious pizza, bread, pastries, chicken, etc. Delicious at your fingertips. 【Details Make the Oven Intimate】：Our commercial countertop ovenstake more details into account for you. We use magnetic sealing strips to lock the internal temperature, which can effectively reduce heat loss. Dense vents promote airflow and efficiently dissipate heat, keeping the oven on for longer. Suspension door design, can stay at any angle. 【Premium Stainless Steel Body and Double Layer Heat Resistant Explosion-Proof Glass Door】The sturdy stainless steel body is extremely durable, perfectly resistant to rust and corrosion, and easier to clean. It is also equipped with a double-layer heat-resistant explosion-proof glass door to avoid heat loss. The cool-touch handle on the door, avoiding burns and keeping you safe. Oven lights allow you to keep an eye on the surface of your food and keep an eye on the progress of cooking inside","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51o7D6hlOGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pokytcox","source_asin":"B09W5HQBJL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-214333","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W5HQBJL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W5HQBJL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
