window.products.push({"id":214349,"name":"30th Birthday Balloon 30th Birthday Decorations Burgundy 30 Balloons Happy 30th Birthday Party Supplies Number 30 Foil Mylar Balloons Latex Balloon Gi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SlJBxyj9S._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"30th Birthday Balloon 30th Birthday Decorations Burgundy 30 Balloons Happy 30th Birthday Party Supplies Number 30 Foil Mylar Balloons Latex Balloon Gifts for Girls,Boys,Women,Men This giant 30 Burgundy balloon is a great choice to achieve that splendid party you’ve ever imagined. This isn’t just suitable for birthday party. It’s an ideal embellishment even for couples celebrating their 30th anniversary or organizations, schools, and businesses cheering for its 30th foundation day. The large Burgundy ballon numbers makes an excellent centerpiece, just inflate it with helium or air to get it ready and put on show. It even comes with tabs attached on the top and bottom to make it easier to tie to a balloon weight, or string across the wall. Material: Mylar foil balloons, With premium material for durable and reusable use Color: Burgundy (Girl's favorite color) Package includes: 16 inch \"HAPPY BIRTHDAY DAY\" banner balloons 40 Inch Burgundy foil balloons \"30\" set 2pcs 18 inch mylar loving heart balloons 2pcs 18 inch mylar star balloons 10 pcs confetti balloons 12pcs latex balloon(6pcs Burgundy  latex balloons and 6pcs white latex balloons) Suggested Uses: - Party Decorations Centerpiece. - Photo Props for Photo Shoot. - Re-use several times for variety of occasions. - Special wedding, celebration, holiday, birthday, party activities. Seller Warranty: Whether you have any questions about the product, including product content, returns, refunds, you can contact us directly, or you can contact Amazon customer service directly for a refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SlJBxyj9S._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLZLMM","source_asin":"B093C9BCKS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-214349","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093C9BCKS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093C9BCKS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":214350,"name":"Panasonic NN-SF550M \"FLAT INTERIOR CAVITY\" 1.0 cuft, 1000-Watt Microwave with Inverter Technology, Black w/silver wrap","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CZBZ5jsEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Panasonic NN-SF550M Flat & Wide Countertop Microwave Oven Easy-to-clean flat-bottom surface. Click here for a larger image Spacious oven capacity with room for large or multiple dishes. Click here for a larger image Microwave antenna rotates underneath to evenly distribute microwaves to every part of the oven for evenly cooked food. Click here for a larger image Large oven capacity with space for large or multiple dishes. With its sleek black front and silver wrap, this 1000-watt microwave oven by Panasonic makes a stylish and convenient addition to any contemporary kitchen. Ideal for a busy family, the 1.0-cubic-foot countertop oven provides quick and easy meal preparation--anything from breakfast foods and after-school snacks to dinnertime meals and appetizers when entertaining. No-Turntable Design Thanks to its wide and flat bottom, the oven can accommodate larger-size dishes or more than one dish at a time. Food still cooks with the same even-heating benefit of a turntable, though. The appliance instead comes equipped with a unique microwave antenna that rotates underneath to evenly distribute the microwaves to every part of the oven for thorough, consistent heating with no hot spots. Inverter Technology Moving Beyond Just \"Heating Things Up\" Many people just use their microwaves for making popcorn or warming up soup because most microwaves just have one temperature setting--high. Conventional microwave ovens might have a low-power setting, but this is achieved by \"pulsing\" the high-power setting on and off rather than by emitting a steady stream of low-powered energy. Panasonic's trailblazing Inverter technology delivers true, variable microwave power, which means even temperatures and consistent textures throughout the food being cooked. The consistent delivery of microwave energy allows delicate foods to simmer without the edges and surfaces overcooking, so foods have the look and taste you expect--without the wait. The Inverter microwave oven perfects the art of cooking, taking microwave cooking to a whole new level. You'll experience delicious food that better retains its color, nutrients, and flavor and that's easier and faster to prepare. Oh, and you can still make great popcorn. Single, Compact Power Supply Furthermore, the Inverter power unit is smaller and lighter than conventional microwave circuitry (aka the heavy, enclosed side of the microwave), which allows for more interior space to fit that favorite casserole dish, without increasing the oven's overall exterior dimensions. Weighing just 25-1/2 pounds, the oven's roomy interior measures 14-3/8 inches long by 13-5/16 inches wide by 9-15/16 high, while its compact exterior measures 15-13/16 inches long by 20-11/16 inches wide by 12-1/4 inches high. Additional Features Inverter Turbo Defrost Defrost foods even faster than with the previous Panasonic Auto Defrost. Panasonic Inverter Turbo Defrost technology is an advanced microwave sequencing system using the inverter continuous-power delivery method. Auto Cook and Reheat The oven's one-touch buttons take the guesswork out of cooking and reheating by automatically adjusting power levels and calculating cooking times for various food types like oatmeal, beverages, frozen entrees, soup, potatoes, vegetables, and pasta. Quick Minute The one-touch button allows you to automatically set the time in increments of one minute. Keep Warm Feature A pulsing delivery of very low microwave power keeps food temperatures at a constant level--without overcooking. So, foods like stew, gravy, and desserts remain warm in the oven for up to 30 minutes after cooking. Flat & Wide Since no turntable is needed, you can conveniently cook multiple dishes. Clock/Timer Convenient time-of-day clock and count-down timer (up to 99 minutes and 99 seconds). Child-Safety Lock For safety, the child lock prevents electronic operation (door still opens). Press Start three times to lock (key icon will display); press Stop/Reset three times to cancel. Control Panel with Push-Button Door Release Easy-to-open door means quick, easy access to the inside; one-touch control panel ensures effortless operation. Other Highlights The oven also provides an easy-to-clean interior, 10 power levels, three cooking stages, more/less control, a popcorn button, and delay start. Good Housekeeping Seal Awarded the Good Housekeeping Seal of Approval, the oven carries a two-year limited warranty. Push-button controls and digital display for easy programming. Click here for a larger image Click here to view the set-up guide. Make Mealtime Marvelous Create all your favorite recipes, quickly and easily, with Panasonic's Inverter microwave oven. Eggs Eggs Appetizers Appetizers Soups Casseroles Fish/seafood Meats Pasta/grains/cereals Poultry Sauces Vegetable side dishes Pies Desserts & breads   Free cookbook: Master Chefs Microwave Recipes Made Easy. Click here to viewPanasonic & The Culinary Institute of America Get Things CookingPanasonic Inverter micro","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CZBZ5jsEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panasonic","source_asin":"B003AM7UUS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-214350","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003AM7UUS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003AM7UUS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
