window.products.push({"id":214384,"name":"Palace Imports 100 mm Bolts and Half-Moon/Crescent/Lunar Nuts B100, Pack of 4. 1/4 Inch Thread. Best for Made in Brazil Beds/Bunk Beds with 2.5 Inch P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617hF7-ANlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hard to find replacement hardware for beds and bunk beds typically made in Brazil. With the lengths of 100, 110, 120 and 150 mm, the bolts are suitable for the posts from 2.5 to 4.5 inches. The nuts, known as half-moon, lunar or crescent and virtually non-existent on the US market, are indispensable for the rail to post connections. Most other beds and bunk beds use barrel nuts which are usually incompatible with the Brazilian-made furniture. Made of Zamak, a strong Zinc alloy, this hardware is secure and long lasting. Bolt Length: 100mm Bolt Thread: 1/4\" Nut Shape: Half-Moon or Crescent or Lunar Nut Thread: 1/4\" Material: Metal Alloy Quantity In One Package: 4 Bolts and 4 Nuts Commonly Used For: - Metal to metal bed or bunk bed rail connection - Best for pine wood furniture imported from Brazil","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617hF7-ANlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Palace Imports","source_asin":"B00GW4RFTC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-214384","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GW4RFTC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GW4RFTC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
