window.products.push({"id":214601,"name":"2 Pack Glass Water Carafe Pitchers with Lid and Tag, 1 Liter Iced Tea Beverage Pitcher Set, Milk Juice Container for Refrigerator, Glass Juice Pitcher","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AKS6tZzvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2 PACK GLASS PITCHERS -- The 1-liter water pitcher set includes 2 * glass carafe pitchers, 2 *bamboo lids, and 2 * wooden tags. The tight-fitting bamboo lid ensures iced tea pitcher won't leak, prevent messy spills while providing an airtight fit to keep drinks fresh. Wooden tags help identify the beverages in glass water carafe. Perfect for serving juices in mimosa bar, brunch, party. FOOD-GRADE & DISHWASHER SAFE -- Made of superior thicker glass, Polegas glass pitcher with lid is more durable and stronger than other flimsy juice carafes. It has nice shatter-resistance, cracks resistance and totally lead-free and BPA-free. You can free to use our glass pitcher with lid to prepare and beverages, iced tea, lemonade, cold brew. Plus our water carafe pitchers are dishwasher safe, no need to waste time on cleaning. TIPS: NOT FOR BOILING HOT WATER. FIT IN FRIDGE & EASY TO POUR -- 1000ml/35 oz, juice pitcher is large enough for daily drinks, bedsides use, picnic carry, and party use. Each lemonade pitcher is 10.4 inches high and 3.6 inches wide, fits well in refrigerator doors and inter layers. Plus, we shape the beverage carafe juice containers in a classic and elegant design with a narrow neck, which is easy to hold and pour, reducing beverage spills. MULTI-PURPOSE & GOOD FOR GIFTING -- The clear pitcher with lids and tags allows to display all kinds of beautiful beverages. Perfect decor for serving milk, water, juice, sangria, wine, and cocktail at Mimosa Bar, barbecues, brunch and gatherings parties. With these stylish ice tea glass carafe set, your party will look more attractive and dynamic. It also can be a good gift for Birthdays, Housewarming gifts, Tea Sets, Christmas Gifts or any given occasion. 100% SATISFIED SERVICE -- Your fridge juice pitcher will arrive bubble wrapped and securely boxed, complete with our robust 180 days Warranty. Polegas crafted carafes for mimosa bar won’t let you down. If the glass sangria pitcher set you received was damaged or imperfect or you are not 100% satisfied, please contact us, we will try our best to offer a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AKS6tZzvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polegas","source_asin":"B0B5CXWSM5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-214601","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5CXWSM5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5CXWSM5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
