window.products.push({"id":214635,"name":"CREOSA Bath Towels Set of 8 Dark Grey, 100% Long Staple Ring Spun Combed Cotton Highly Absorbent Towels Includes 2 Hand Towels, 2 Bath Towels and 4 Wa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sCLklw34L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ABSORBENT COTTON TOWELS SET: When you buy towels, you want a set that feels great on your skin and absorbs moisture. We get it, that’s why we’ve crafted luxe 600 GSM grey towel sets for bathroom and Dark Gray hand towel that makes your skin happy. We achieve this by using only the finest combed cotton with low-twisting yarns so there’s more air & space in between the fibres to give you highly absorbent cotton towels. Our bundle of care is soft, caring, and comes in convenient packs too! 8 PC PREMIUM TOWEL SETS: Includes 2 Bath Towels in size 27”X54”, 2 Hand Towels in size 16”X30”, 4 Washcloths in size 13”X13”. Your all-in-one 8 PC cotton towel set in matching colors takes care of your daily requirement from your kitchen to the bathroom. From cotton hand towels for bathrooms, to dry towels for body the premium towel set is both pleasant to touch and long lasting. 100% LONG STAPLE RING-SPUN COMBED COTTON: The ring-spun cotton fabric gives towel sets the premium hotel-like feel while making your towels noticeably finer, durable & offer a soft experience every day. The shorter threads are removed to only keep the longest fine yarns, and furthermore, the tight weave ensures the grey towel sets for bathroom are highly absorbent, and resilient. The specially designed loop orientation gives you feel good fluffiness. What’s more, our towels are made sustainably! MADE FOR YOU & OUR PLANET: We’re eco-friendly and our process is sustainable because we believe the future is green. We use zero harmful chemicals that make our towel set ideal for your family while being mindful of our environment and sustainable living. QUALITY YOU CAN TRUST Each piece is checked before the package reaches you. We’re BSCI compliant and OEKO-TEX 100 Standard Company, which basically means that the fabric used for crafting your towels set is individually checked and audited to high safety standards for you and your family. With rigorous processing, packaging, and quality-oriented approach we believe in giving only the best, that’s why we also give you a guarantee!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sCLklw34L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CREOSA","source_asin":"B0B1VLVN64","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-214635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1VLVN64","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1VLVN64","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
