window.products.push({"id":214691,"name":"Shark Hanging Laundry Bag With Stainless Steel Hooks, Laundry Hampers With Zipper Collapsible Laundry Baskets For Bedroom, Space Saving Laundry Bag.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UleBVWuTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Convenient And Zipper At The Bottom】This Clothing Hamper Is Light Weight And Easy To Install. The Wide Opening Design For Easier Load Your Clothes Or Anything Else. Meanwhile, The Zipper At The Bottom Of Front Let You Quickly Unload Things Inside. When It'S Ready To Do The Laundry, You Just Put The Laundry Basket Under It, Unzip It And All Drops Into The Basket. Very Convenient! 【Durability And Machine Washable】This Hanging Laundry Hamper Is Well Made Of High Density Oxford Fabric,And Reinforced Sewing Thread On Side Sew, Hanging Loops And Zipper, Made This Laundry Bag Is Supper Durable. The Perfect Auto Lock Zipper Is Very Smooth And Will Not Zip On Clothes Inside. This Hanging Laundry Bag Can Be Machine Washable And Still Keep The Shape After Washed. 【Functional And Space Saver】The Large Storage Capacity Of This Hamper Bag Is Large Enough To Hold A Lot Of Dirty Clothes For The Whole Family, And It’s Helpful For Storage Any Kind Of Clothes, Scarves, Hats, Bedclothes And Travelling…Really Save Space. It'S Highly Recommended For Small Spaces And Laundry Room, Like Families And College Dorms Who Need More Room. 【4 Free Hanging Hooks】2 Stainless Steel Hooks And 2 Adhesive Hooks, You Can Hang This Laundry Basket Bag Behind The Door Or Anywhere You Like. The Stainless Steel Hooks Are Adjustable, Can Fit The Door Thickness Range At 1.37in -1.97inch. Really Value For Money! 【Space Saving Laundry Basket】Free Your Floor - With Compact Design And Strong Hanging Loops, This Hanging Laundry Hamper Bag Can Be Hung Behind The Door In Bedroom, Bathroom, Closet, Dorm Or Anywhere You Like. Foldable Laundry Basket Can Be Fold Into A Small Size When You Don'T Need It. Space Saving Solution For Small Spaces And Large Families.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UleBVWuTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iunmvhc","source_asin":"B09JJN8LMP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-214691","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JJN8LMP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JJN8LMP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
