window.products.push({"id":214793,"name":"Bath Towel Set for Bathroom, 100% Cotton 6 Piece Shower Towels - 2 Large Multicolor Towels, 2 Hand Towels, 2 Washcloths (Dull Red/Grey, 6-Piece Towel ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xo75vKkTS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Highly Absorbent 1)The bath towel set is made of 100% cotton which is extra soft and highly absorbent. 2)The cotton towels can absorb the weight of water more than five times of its own. 3)We test twice to coordinate the usage experience and product quality, 500 GSM is not too thick to use properly or too thin to last. Soft & Durable These cotton washcloths are weaved by the Sirospun Technology which we use two-fold yarns for weaving because they are stronger, and the twisting operation binds the surface fibers into the yarn structure so that it is smoother and more resistant to abrasion. Care Guide 1)It is recommended to rinse it to remove the floating hair on the surface before first use 2)Washing water temperature should not exceed 30 degrees (high temperature soaking will damage the structure of the fiber) 3)Wash separately from other products to avoid staining and avoid prolonged drying 4)It is not recommended to iron 5)Keep the place ventilated and dry 6)Using fabric softeners will adversely affect the water absorption of towels 7)Use time should not exceed 3 months 8)If the towel feels oily, it is recommended to wash it after soaking in concentrated brine 9)If towels are inevitably fatigued due to daily use or frequent washing, we recommend donating the towels to a local animal shelter or re-cutting them for cleaning rags, which is good for our environment. 10)It is recommended to put it in the laundry bag every time you wash. 11) After the bath towel is used, it should be dried in time to avoid peculiar smell.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xo75vKkTS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maggieisamazing","source_asin":"B08C9QJL5G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-214793","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C9QJL5G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C9QJL5G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
