window.products.push({"id":214840,"name":"Melange New Italian Villa Premium Porcelain 20-Piece Place Setting, Black, Serving for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F1w3stigL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mélange is about the essence of meals. It is designed to coordinate with your existing heirloom pottery as well as mix and match with formal and casual stemware and flatware. The premium porcelain material makes it suitable to serve your meals from the microwave; the large mugs are designed to welcome you in the mornings; the sophisticated yet functional design of the fine china place setting lets you shine during sushi for two or other special meals. The chip resistant plates will perform at your fiesta parties every time and wash white and clean in your dishwasher. It is vitrified to withstand everyday basic catering and can also be used as a commercial hotel collection or at the grand buffet of a wedding. Porcelain is harder and more durable than stoneware or earthenware. The water porosity is close to 0 percent while in stoneware it could be as much as 2%. Greater the water porosity greater the possibility of moisture retention in dinnerware and hence lesser the durability. Stoneware is vitrified at approx. 40% lower temperatures compared to Porcelain. Due to this they can scratch more easily. New Italian Villa dinnerware captures the life style of Tuscan nobility living in Italian Villa with views of breath-taking countryside. The dishware is inspired by columnar design of Italian mansions and has subtle ripples giving it truly a rich and aristocratic feel. The functional and yet timeless form gives the host plenty of opportunities to impress at formal dinner parties or at outdoor lunches on warm sunny afternoons. Each piece combines various aspects of famous Italian style and mixes and matches well with other conventional dinnerware and modern dining sets. Ready for life in an Italian Villa? New Italian Villa is a great commercial product safe for cutting on with knives and keeping the food surface non-absorbent. Available in 20, 30, 40-piece place settings. It's a great for a wedding, birthday or Christmas gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F1w3stigL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B00H1IJ12C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-214840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00H1IJ12C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00H1IJ12C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":214841,"name":"Panasonic RA41660 Electric Thermo Pot Water Boiler Dispenser NC-EG3000, Slow-Drip Mode for Coffee, Ideal for Tea, Hot Cocoa, Soups and Baby Food, Four","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":110.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PhEBimkSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether hosting a business meeting, catering an event, or simply upping the convenience quota of everyday life, The Panasonic electric thermo pot hot water boiler dispenser NC-EG3000 makes it easy to quickly and safely boil and dispense hot water. Featuring a 3. 2 quart (3. 0 liter) Capacity and slow-drip Coffee mode, the thermos hot pot is perfect for anything from tea, instant Coffee and hot cocoa to instant soup, noodles, baby food and more. The exceptionally versatile unit includes four precise automatic temperature settings to heat and keep water hot for hours, allowing you to maintain optimum temperatures for a variety of foods and beverages. The surface of the stainless-steel inner pot is precision coated with bincho-tan charcoal to purify and alkalize the pH level of hot water and naturally extract more flavorful elements in tea. A non-stick coating of Diamond fluorine is also added to ensure durability and easy cleaning. Front-facing touch buttons easily set and control all temperatures and modes, including slow-drip Coffee, water recoil and programming the thermos pot's energy-saving 6-hour timer. Other conveniences include an enlarged, easy-to-see gauge includes a bright Red floating indicator to accurately display water level and let you know when refilling is needed, and a removable, push-button lid that opens wide for quicker, more convenient refilling and minimizes spills while adding water. The pot's fold-down carrying handle makes it effortless to transport from the sink for filling to the buffet table or counter When entertaining guests or working in the kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PhEBimkSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panasonic","source_asin":"B01M5CUL7O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-214841","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M5CUL7O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M5CUL7O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":214842,"name":"ACME Furniture Northville Platform, Antique Champagne","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1583.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917nBue3vaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Northville eastern king bed is exclusively designed and filled with romantic spirit. A piece crafted and inspired by the luxurious designs of the past, this gorgeous panel bed features a stunning arched faux leather antique headboard with footboard and side rails, all in antique champagne finish. Expertly detailed, this gorgeous bed features a button tufted headboard with nail head trim and elaborate carvings on its wood frame. With floral accents, raised crown molding and scrolled corners this uniquely designed panel bed will make a statement in any bedroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917nBue3vaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Acme Furniture","source_asin":"B0869WV75M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-214842","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0869WV75M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0869WV75M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
