window.products.push({"id":214977,"name":"NEW Solar Sun Power Car Auto Fan Air Vent Cool Cooler Ventilation System Radiator (Buy 1 Get 1 FREE)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b6Ka8p4qL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"On hot days, just cracking your car windows isn't enough: you return to hot, stale air. The Solar Auto Fan is a simple, inexpensive way to prevent the build up of hot, stale air while your car is parked. This clever, solar-powered fan draws in fresh air and blows out hot air. Finally, getting into your car in summer can be a more pleasant experience. Prevents heat build-up while parked. Fan blows hot air out as it draws fresh air in. Helps to eliminate pet and tobacco odors. Fits any car window. No batteries required. Includes solar battery. Slowly Draws out Hot Air Through out the day thus making your Vehicle more tolerable at end of day when entering.. Also helps eliminate Oder's while drawing Fresh air in..  Note: This is a Slow Draw Fan that Draws out Hot Air Through out the day thus making your Vehicle more tolerable at end of day when entering. Installation Instruction: Roll down the front or rear window on your car about 4-5 inches Chip the auto vent cooler deluxe onto the window Next size the weather stripping fit in both ends of the auto vent cooler deluxe. Slide the remaining weather stripping onto the opposite side of the window and work your way to the auto vent cooler deluxe Slowly Roll the window closed Crack the opposite window for best results","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b6Ka8p4qL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IdeaWorks","source_asin":"B01HGGDZK2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-214977","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HGGDZK2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HGGDZK2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
